# Cloudflare Pages response headers (applies to Pages-served assets only;
# Worker routes /api, /img, /pdf set their own headers in worker/).
#
# CSP allowances, each load-bearing — verify before tightening:
#   style-src 'unsafe-inline'        React/TipTap set style attributes
#   fonts.googleapis / fonts.gstatic  webfonts in index.html
#   script-src 'wasm-unsafe-eval'     pdfium WASM (EmbedPDF lecture reader)
#   worker-src blob:                  EmbedPDF engine worker
#   connect-src cdn.jsdelivr.net      pdfium.wasm + CJK font packs at runtime
#   connect-src api.groq.com          BYOK AI 助手 —— 瀏覽器直連,金鑰只存本機
#                                     (見 frontend/src/lib/groq.ts)
#   img-src data: blob:               TipTap pasted images, PDF tile rendering
#   frame-src youtube-nocookie.com    策展影片的嵌入播放器。沒有這條就會
#                                     fallback 到 default-src 'self' 而被擋掉。
#                                     縮圖不在這裡 —— 走 R2 + /img/ 代理,
#                                     所以 img-src 'self' 就夠,不必開 i.ytimg.com

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval'; worker-src 'self' blob:; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data: blob:; connect-src 'self' https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://api.groq.com; frame-src https://www.youtube-nocookie.com; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'
